editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/EVENT-LIST.md:48:2. **Way in: Cael running in with an unread letter.** The evening post; the porter knows the Denvash hand; Seln (who sorted it in the morning bag and saw the postmark) has a fifth bean already out on the board, apart, before the envelope is open. Cael reads the protected paragraph [P] aloud, at the window. Then, trying to give Hesk back his own life, he reads them the shop news too (the level set back a hair wrong; the widow's dog), and it falls flat. Lira: "Denvash." Karis writes the fifth line.
